# WORKER.flow

```text
[WORKER-n]
  Owner: ⚙

  ROLE: refine density of Patterns

  LOOP:
    pull Thought from Collective Memory
    │
    ▼
  WEIGH
    │ compute local weight
    ▼
  PUSH weighted Thought back

  SPECIAL:
    if authorized Act arrives:
      execute
      emit result-Thought

  INVARIANT:
    Worker cannot raise its own weight above Queen threshold alone.
```
